add('N052','F. Formal completion and the SGA 2 leaves','The Hom map controlling full faithfulness',[(32,13)],'unproved claim',r'“on est ramené à prouver”; “Comme … le Module dual”',r'Hom|endomorph|projector|projecteur|Lefschetz|formal',r'''The proof replaces morphisms \(F\to G\) by sections of \(H=\underline{\operatorname{Hom}}(F,G)\) and studies \(H^0(U,H)\to H^0(\widehat X,\widehat H)\), then ends during the dual-module argument. Completing that proof requires the coherent extension of the dual and the displayed comparison maps for a presentation by vector bundles, with the arbitrary-neighbourhood step accounted for.''',r'''The explicit Hom map is relevant to the endomorphism language in WG2 §2.1 #2 and the effectivity lead MPL_14_002-044 §107, but neither excerpt identifies its projectors with endomorphisms of these vector bundles; the current page supplies a possible comparison map, not that missing identification.''',['WG2 §2.1 #2','MPL_14_002-044 §107'])
